#: desc: Without the parameter A, DSUB leaves the names of anchors as they are
-v COLOR=0 -v DSUB='$(OUT_DIR):out' test/fixtures/Makefile.dsub-names
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
$(OUT_DIR)/a       Write out/a
$(OUT_DIR)/b       Write b (after out/a)
plain              A target without the variable in its name

-----------------------
Command-line arguments:
-----------------------
$(OUT_DIR)_FLAGS   Flags used for the files in out
